--- PREAMBLE ---

This license exists because software licensing has become a weapon,
not a shield. The goal is transparency and collaboration:

1. Use this code. Freely. Even in closed-source products.
2. Ensure that the required attribution and copyright notices are preserved and easily
   accessible, to make the chain-of-provenance documentation available.
3. CoP intends to allow users and developers to make code traceable back to the
   original authors wherever this is beneficial. Use it wisely.
4. If you train an AI on this code and it memorizes parts of it,
   don't pretend the AI wrote it. Credit the original.

If you see that as a huge entanglement, don't use the code.

